[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16741.039, "timestamp": "04:39:01", "text": "它不像是一次轻松的合作，或者 聚会之类的活动。它将成为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16743.52, "timestamp": "04:39:03", "text": "聚会之类的活动。它将成为 就像一种正规的专业合作方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16746.0, "timestamp": "04:39:06", "text": "就像一种正规的专业合作方式 某种格式的东西，这有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16749.0, "timestamp": "04:39:09", "text": "某种格式的东西，这有点 疼痛。呃，但我还是想问问那里的情况。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16750.175, "timestamp": "04:39:10", "author": "@Roku-rin", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8LlS_C2IirDMfA5r2V0q5G1kudp8dmG6RQvz_jCAUT3H-esyEgTNPDwrfCXiyX7Undc9UmHNgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "like how you been or can we hang again?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16753.52, "timestamp": "04:39:13", "text": "疼痛。呃，但我还是想问问那里的情况。 是我希望喜欢的人，让他们加入新团队。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16756.561, "timestamp": "04:39:16", "text": "是我希望喜欢的人，让他们加入新团队。 新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16762.39, "timestamp": "04:39:22", "text": "人们会问你最近怎么样，或者我们能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16766.39, "timestamp": "04:39:26", "text": "又挂断了？是的。我想问"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16768.15, "timestamp": "04:39:28", "text": "那。问题是他们不认识我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16772.07, "timestamp": "04:39:32", "text": "对于过去的大多数人来说。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16774.629, "timestamp": "04:39:34", "text": "只通过私信之类的方式随机联系过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16778.15, "timestamp": "04:39:38", "text": "莫名其妙地问我愿不愿意合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16780.628, "timestamp": "04:39:40", "text": "我希望他们不要把这看作是一件坏事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16783.83, "timestamp": "04:39:43", "text": "但我还是会像寿司那样问问。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16786.948, "timestamp": "04:39:46", "text": "好像问他们是否还算可以似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16788.868, "timestamp": "04:39:48", "text": "不想做，也没兴趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16792.47, "timestamp": "04:39:52", "text": "那很好。就是这样。我确实得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16794.948, "timestamp": "04:39:54", "text": "我正在尝试获取BBC"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16798.07, "timestamp": "04:39:58", "text": "BBC上写过关于我的记者"}]